   "text": "Institute Admin · final complete-role design (V3 Refined B, foundation XR-V3-RB-1.0). Status: FINAL — OWNER APPROVED, 21 Oct 2026. Every owned screen now uses one design language: the refined Overview, Content access, Student access, People and Course codes, and the same record, list and guided-step patterns on every other screen. The large board is the whole role, connected: press Play, pick a sample world or a journey, and click through. The coverage register lists every owned screen and subview with its status. Other pages: Screens · 1440, States, Responsive. This is the approved design: the exported source and screenshot archives are built from exactly these files."
